spice
* SPICE netlist

* Voltage Source
V1 4 0 DC Vin

* Current Source
Iin 6 0 DC I1

* Capacitors
CL 5 6 CL
Cin 2 0 Cin

* Resistors
RS 4 3 RS
RO 3 6 ro

* NMOS Transistor
* D G S
M1 6 2 3 3 NMOS

* Nodes
* 1: Vout
* 2: Vb
* 3: Source of NMOS and one end of ro
* 4: Vin
* 5: Node between CL and ro
* 6: VDD